00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:07.613
So aesthetics are very important.

00:09:07.613 --> 00:09:09.582
We in Taiwan need to cultivate aesthetics.

00:09:09.582 --> 00:09:10.316
Technical skills

00:09:10.316 --> 00:09:11.918
